# 05_weapons: d3dm4 hall. A rocket, a plasma burst, a shotgun blast and a grenade against the far wall.
# Impulses: 3 shotgun, 7 grenade, 8 plasma gun, 9 rocket launcher.
map game/mp/d3dm4
at 0 god
at 0 notarget
at 0 noclip
at 1 setviewpos 272 300 68 270
at 2 give all
impulse 3 9
move 50 52 attack
impulse 90 8
move 130 160 attack
impulse 170 3
move 205 207 attack
impulse 230 7
move 260 275 attack
end 330
capture 0 330 every=10 fps=60
capture 54 61
capture 140 145
